\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nJoeun is an American of Korean ancestry that does not speak Korean. She recently came to South Korea for an exchange. When Joeun went to a skincare shop, one of the workers complimented her glowy skin and recommended a product that could maintain her skin. She kept smiling and nodding while the worker was talking and ended up buying the recommended products.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would the worker ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Joy\nB) Disapproval\nC) Annoyance\nD) Surprise\nE) Sadness\nF) Delight\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would the worker feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) the worker had an agreeing customer who bought their product\nB) the worker didn't expect Joeun to speak Korean\nC) Joeun pretended to understand Korean while just nodding her head\nD) the worker couldn't believe Joeun could speak Korean","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590638937927973,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8b3d6006945d280a15f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369715872,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:55","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ff425c4838bc4d9a9571dc3e7d19902c"}